# Keep test fixtures in examples/ unignored:
# First, un-ignore the examples/ directory
!examples/
# Re-add the fixture logs that tests/conftest.py fixtures point at so
# `pytest` finds them in a fresh checkout and test_analyze_apache_file,
# test_analyze_mixed_file, etc. don't fail with Click bad-path exit 2.
!examples/apache-sample.log
!examples/mixed.log
# Other *.log files inside examples/ are not tracked fixtures and can
# still be ignored so ad-hoc files don't get committed by accident.
examples/*.log
